    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but i really just want to avoid the doctor if i can. i have some extra aspirin and some of those salt tablets my friend uses for heat exhaustion... if i just take one of those and lay down, would that help stabilize me so i don't have another episode? i'd rather just handle it myself tonight.",
